    "chunk_text": "a fram \u00feam pytte & his suna hine naman mid litlingum & mid heora wifum & mid \u00feam & ealle \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee he ahte on chanaan lande & he com \u00fea to egypta lande mid eallum his kynne. So\u00f0lice \u00feis synd israhela naman \u00fee uoran in to egypta lande he mid his sunum Se frumcenneda ruben. & rubenes sunu Enoh & fallu & charm. Simeones suna Gamuel & Diamin & achod & iachim & Saher & Sauw, Chana Nytedes suna. & Leuies suna ierson & caa\u00f0 & merari. Iudas suna Her & onham & Sela & fares & saram her & onham for\u00f0ferdon on chanaan lande; & \u00deis w\u00e6ron isachares suna, Thola & phua & iob & semron. & \u00f0is w\u00e6ron zabules suna, Sared & elon & iaelel. \u00d0ys synd lian suna \u00fee heo akende on mesopotamia sirie myd dian hire dehter \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ron ealra III & \u00d0is w\u00e6ron gaades suna, sephio & Thagis Suni & essebon her & arodi & areli. \u00d0is w\u00e6ron asseras suna, Gamme & iessui & iesua & b\u00e6ria & sara heora sweostor. \u00d0is w\u00e6ron racheles suna Iacobes wiues, Iosep & beniamin. & Iosep gestrynde suna on Egypta lande be Asenehte Putiphares dohter \u00fe\u00e6s sacerdes of Eliopoleus \u00d0is w\u00e6ron Beniamines suna, Bela & Bethor & Arbel Iera & Naam, Rehi & Rosmoim & Opfam & Rachel akende be Iacobe XIII suna. \u00deus hatte Danis suna, Vsim. \u00deis w\u00e6ron Naptalimes suna, Hasiel & Gum & Iesser & Salem. Witodlice Iacob",
